WEBVTT

00:24:28.079 --> 00:24:30.746
I am not I'm not down with
it yet. I don't get it.

00:24:30.913 --> 00:24:32.746
And Michael Rumble what's what's
what do you think?

00:24:33.454 --> 00:24:35.496
And as you and I both know,

00:24:35.829 --> 00:24:38.913
one way to really measure embedded
change in in cultures,

00:24:38.913 --> 00:24:44.204
which is a hard thing to do. Right, is
language like language is a big indicator.

00:24:44.246 --> 00:24:48.121
And so I think you can't just start using

00:24:48.121 --> 00:24:53.496
the word rumble if it's not paired
with a deeper culture change.

00:24:55.121 --> 00:24:56.454
I think that makes a lot of sense,

00:24:56.454 --> 00:25:00.496
and it it leaves me wondering a little
bit if if actually wondering a lot.